{
    "title": "Futorum H6 Digital watch face",
    "description": "The watch face has a simple high-tech style design for the best display of information.\r\nThe unique feature of this watch face is a day and night world map, which is updated in real time. Your current location is also marked on this map.\r\n\r\n<b>Full functionality is available after purchasing a subscription.</b>\r\n1. You can subscribe in the watch face settings menu.\r\nTo open the menu make a long tap in the center of the screen, then tap on the settings icon at the bottom of the screen.\r\nClick the \"Subscribe\" button, then after clicking on the \"Subscribe\" button, on the linked smartphone, in the notification line, you will be prompted to subscribe.\r\nOpen it and follow the Google Play instructions.\r\n2. You can also subscribe in the companion app.\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#00A200\">This watch face is available on devices running Wear OS 2.4 and 3+ (API 28+), primarily the Samsung Galaxy Watch 4/5/6 & Google Pixel Watch/2.</font></b>\r\n<b><font color=\"#C10000\">Devises running Huawei Lite OS and Samsung Tizen NOT SUPPORTED.</font></b>\r\n\r\nThe watch face shows digital time, date, battery level, sunrise or sunset time, moon phase, moonrise or moonset time, steps and distance traveled, heart rate, history of heart rate measurement and upcoming event.\r\n\r\nAvailable in 7 color themes and 8 colors for the symbol of time.\r\nThere are two progress bars on the watch face - steps to the goal and battery level.\r\n\r\nThe watch face also displays additional digital time for the selected time zone. You can select the time zone in the watch face settings menu.\r\n\r\nIn the watch face settings, you can set the stride length according to your height. This will help for a more accurate calculation of the distance traveled.\r\n\r\nThe area containing alarm shortcut can be replaced with any app shortcut you like. \r\nThe upper area for complications is not filled by default. Customize it if necessary through the watch face menu.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udea9 IMPORTANT NOTES</b>\r\n\u2022 After installing the watch face, you need to install application shortcuts and complications widgets as you wish.\r\n\u2022 This watch face independently measures your heart rate. This watch face does not receive data from stock Wear OS heart rate apps. \r\n\u2022 All information about sunrise / sunset, moon age, moonrise / moonset, etc. is calculated by the watch face independently of stock apps.\r\n\u2022 To calculating the sunrise / sunset, moonrise / moonset, displaying the day and night world map, etc. you need to enable the \"Location\" option on both the watch and the smartphone.\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#00A200\">Functionality</font></b>\r\n\u2714 - <b>available for free</b>\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 - <b>available after a paid subscription</b>\r\n\r\n<b>\u2705 DAY & NIGHT WORLD MAP</b>\r\n\u2714 Real-time updated world map showing the change of day and night\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Your location on the world map\r\n<b>\u2705 WORLD TIME</b>\r\n\u2714 Digital time (UTC)\r\n\u2714 Time zone code and name\r\n\u2714 Difference in hours from GMT\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Possibility to choose a time zone\r\n<b>\u2705 TIME & DATE</b>\r\n\u2714 Digital time (12h and 24h modes)\r\n\u2714 Date, month, day of the week\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Day of the year, week of the year \r\n<b>\u2705 SUN & MOON</b>\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Sunrise / sunset \r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Moon phase\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Moonrise / moonset\r\n<b>\u2705 CUSTOMIZATION</b>\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 7 color themes\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 8 colors of time symbols\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 1 area for complication widget\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 1 customizable app shortcut\r\n<b>\u2705 STEPS</b>\r\n\u2714 Steps count\r\n\u2714 Progress of steps towards the goal\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Configurable goal of counting steps\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Ability to select an application to receive the number of steps\r\n<b>\u2705 MOVED DISTANCE</b>\r\n\u2714 Moved distance (km or miles)\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Configurable stride length depending on your height\r\n<b>\u2705 HEART RATE</b>\r\n\u2714 Heart rate BPM\r\n\u2714 Color-coded heart rate indicator (low, normal, high)\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Automatic heart rate measurement\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 History of heart rate measurements\r\n<b>\u2705 MISC</b>\r\n\u2714 Battery level\r\n\u2714 Upcoming event\r\n\u2714 Unread notification count\r\n\u2714 Multilingual (supports more than 40 languages)\r\n\r\n\u2709 If you have any questions, please contact us by e-mail support@futorum.com\r\nWe will be happy to assist you!",
    "descriptionHTML": "The watch face has a simple high-tech style design for the best display of information.<br>The unique feature of this watch face is a day and night world map, which is updated in real time. Your current location is also marked on this map.<br><br><b>Full functionality is available after purchasing a subscription.</b><br>1. You can subscribe in the watch face settings menu.<br>To open the menu make a long tap in the center of the screen, then tap on the settings icon at the bottom of the screen.<br>Click the &quot;Subscribe&quot; button, then after clicking on the &quot;Subscribe&quot; button, on the linked smartphone, in the notification line, you will be prompted to subscribe.<br>Open it and follow the Google Play instructions.<br>2. You can also subscribe in the companion app.<br><br><b><font color=\"#00A200\">This watch face is available on devices running Wear OS 2.4 and 3+ (API 28+), primarily the Samsung Galaxy Watch 4/5/6 &amp; Google Pixel Watch/2.</font></b><br><b><font color=\"#C10000\">Devises running Huawei Lite OS and Samsung Tizen NOT SUPPORTED.</font></b><br><br>The watch face shows digital time, date, battery level, sunrise or sunset time, moon phase, moonrise or moonset time, steps and distance traveled, heart rate, history of heart rate measurement and upcoming event.<br><br>Available in 7 color themes and 8 colors for the symbol of time.<br>There are two progress bars on the watch face - steps to the goal and battery level.<br><br>The watch face also displays additional digital time for the selected time zone. You can select the time zone in the watch face settings menu.<br><br>In the watch face settings, you can set the stride length according to your height. This will help for a more accurate calculation of the distance traveled.<br><br>The area containing alarm shortcut can be replaced with any app shortcut you like. <br>The upper area for complications is not filled by default. Customize it if necessary through the watch face menu.<br><br><b>\ud83d\udea9 IMPORTANT NOTES</b><br>\u2022 After installing the watch face, you need to install application shortcuts and complications widgets as you wish.<br>\u2022 This watch face independently measures your heart rate. This watch face does not receive data from stock Wear OS heart rate apps. <br>\u2022 All information about sunrise / sunset, moon age, moonrise / moonset, etc. is calculated by the watch face independently of stock apps.<br>\u2022 To calculating the sunrise / sunset, moonrise / moonset, displaying the day and night world map, etc. you need to enable the &quot;Location&quot; option on both the watch and the smartphone.<br><br><b><font color=\"#00A200\">Functionality</font></b><br>\u2714 - <b>available for free</b><br>\ud83d\udcb2 - <b>available after a paid subscription</b><br><br><b>\u2705 DAY &amp; NIGHT WORLD MAP</b><br>\u2714 Real-time updated world map showing the change of day and night<br>\ud83d\udcb2 Your location on the world map<br><b>\u2705 WORLD TIME</b><br>\u2714 Digital time (UTC)<br>\u2714 Time zone code and name<br>\u2714 Difference in hours from GMT<br>\ud83d\udcb2 Possibility to choose a time zone<br><b>\u2705 TIME &amp; DATE</b><br>\u2714 Digital time (12h and 24h modes)<br>\u2714 Date, month, day of the week<br>\ud83d\udcb2 Day of the year, week of the year <br><b>\u2705 SUN &amp; MOON</b><br>\ud83d\udcb2 Sunrise / sunset <br>\ud83d\udcb2 Moon phase<br>\ud83d\udcb2 Moonrise / moonset<br><b>\u2705 CUSTOMIZATION</b><br>\ud83d\udcb2 7 color themes<br>\ud83d\udcb2 8 colors of time symbols<br>\ud83d\udcb2 1 area for complication widget<br>\ud83d\udcb2 1 customizable app shortcut<br><b>\u2705 STEPS</b><br>\u2714 Steps count<br>\u2714 Progress of steps towards the goal<br>\ud83d\udcb2 Configurable goal of counting steps<br>\ud83d\udcb2 Ability to select an application to receive the number of steps<br><b>\u2705 MOVED DISTANCE</b><br>\u2714 Moved distance (km or miles)<br>\ud83d\udcb2 Configurable stride length depending on your height<br><b>\u2705 HEART RATE</b><br>\u2714 Heart rate BPM<br>\u2714 Color-coded heart rate indicator (low, normal, high)<br>\ud83d\udcb2 Automatic heart rate measurement<br>\ud83d\udcb2 History of heart rate measurements<br><b>\u2705 MISC</b><br>\u2714 Battery level<br>\u2714 Upcoming event<br>\u2714 Unread notification count<br>\u2714 Multilingual (supports more than 40 languages)<br><br>\u2709 If you have any questions, please contact us by e-mail support@futorum.com<br>We will be happy to assist you!",
